{"id":"b3a1ff7b2d65e3d2","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-hereditary-base-order.md","title":"遗传底数表示的严格保序与正规性保持","display":"lem-hereditary-base-order — 遗传底数表示的严格保序与正规性保持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-hereditary-base-order","aliases":["72-lem-hereditary-base-order"],"display":"lem-hereditary-base-order — 遗传底数表示的严格保序与正规性保持","depends_on":["[[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Lemma5.5 and preceding definitions, print191–192/PDF203–204; local normal-form argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-hereditary-base-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-hereditary-base-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hereditary-base-order — 遗传底数表示的严格保序与正规性保持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0e3fa6d930415cd\" href=\"?note=d0e3fa6d930415cd\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-change\">72-df-hereditary-base-change</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Lemma5.5 and preceding definitions, print191–192/PDF203–204; local normal-form argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\le b\\le c&lt;\\omega\">\\(2\\le b\\le c&lt;\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,n\\in\\omega\">\\(m,n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；Her、Bump 与 ord 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0e3fa6d930415cd\" href=\"?note=d0e3fa6d930415cd\" title=\"72-df-hereditary-base-change\">72-df-hereditary-base-change</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&lt;n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{ord}_b(m)&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&lt;n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{ord}_b(m)&lt;\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Her}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{Her}_b(n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Her}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{Her}_b(n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对任意固定底数 b，以 max(m,n) 作强归纳证明第一式。普通底数展开在最大不同指数处按系数比较；各指数小于原正数，归纳假设保证它们的序数值严格同向，故普通位值比较与 Cantor 正规形比较同向。这先完成了所有底数、所有输入的严格保序结论。</p>\n<p>再固定 b≤c，对 n 强归纳证明升底正规性。原展开的各指数 e_j&lt;n；对这些指数使用当前归纳假设，得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(e_j))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(e_j)\">\\(\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(e_j))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(e_j)\\)</span>。右侧随原指数严格递减。现在使用已经对全部输入证明的第一式（底数取 c），反推出升底后指数的自然数值也严格递减，即使这些数值大于 n 也不需套用当前归纳假设。系数仍正且小于 b≤c，因此原表达式在新底求值后就是唯一的 c 正规遗传展开，得到显示的 Her 等式；取同一表达式的 o 值即得序数值等式。n=0 的空展开给两个归纳的边界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-hereditary-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"d0e3fa6d930415cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$2\\le b\\le c<\\omega$，$m,n\\in\\omega$；Her、Bump 与 ord 取 [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"2\\le b\\le c<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"m,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"m<n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{ord}_b(m)<\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Her}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{Her}_b(n),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(n))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ord}_c(\\operatorname{Bump}_{b,c}(e_j))=\\operatorname{ord}_b(e_j)","display":false}],"bytes":2256,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-504","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增9项：[[72-df-goodstein-stopping-time]] · [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-change]] · [[72-df-hereditary-base-expression]] · [[72-df-hereditary-expression-evaluation]] · [[72-ex-goodstein-small-sequence]] · [[72-lem-goodstein-ordinal-descent]] · [[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]] · [[72-thm-goodstein-termination]]"},{"id":"1aae99387ae8003d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$b,a,k\\in\\omega$ 且 $b\\ge2$；G 和 ord 取 [[72-df-goodstein-subtract-then-bump]]、[[72-lem-hereditary-base-order]]。"}],"outgoing":["d0e3fa6d930415cd"]}